        "source_excerpt": "The best scenes should not ask for doctrinal trivia only. Each exam question should force a ruling that affects a person: a prisoner, widow, water carrier, physician, scribe, soldier, oath-maker, or accused heretic. The secret route should reward the player for seeing that both schools are partly serving different safety functions: one guards justice from arbitrary power, the other guards God from being reduced to a creaturely mechanism.\n\n## Source Anchors",
